WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:03.469
-Every major Democrat
in the country

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:04.771
has called on the governor
of Virginia to resign

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.605
after racist photos surfaced

00:00:06.605 --> 00:00:07.974
from his medical-school
yearbook.

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:10.209
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:11.878
♪♪

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:14.847
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:18.384
Just to give you some context,
you might recall that, in 2017,

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.887
the Virginia governor's race
was one of the first

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:22.989
major electoral tests
of the Trump era.

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:25.825
And it revolved, in large part,
on issues of race.

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.327
For example, there was a debate

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:29.295
about the state's
Confederate monuments

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:31.631
with Republican candidate
Ed Gillespie

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:34.434
arguing to keep them
in order to educate people.

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.035
-Our history is our history.

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:38.137
And I believe that we need
to educate about it

00:00:38.137 --> 00:00:40.039
and that we need
to teach about it.

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:44.210
And so, my view is that
the statues should remain,

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.545
and we should place them
in historical context

00:00:46.545 --> 00:00:47.814
so that people can learn.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:50.583
We don't have to glorify
the objects of the statues.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.685
We can educate about them.

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:54.520
-Who uses statues to learn?

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:57.490
Read a book, watch a film,
talk to an expert.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.159
I never see kids
standing in Columbus Circle

00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:03.296
staring at the statue because
they have a test the next day.

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:04.597
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.699
"I got a quiz in an hour,
stone man!

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:07.800
Talk to me!"

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.034
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.034 --> 00:01:10.837
The only thing
I've ever learned from a statue

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:13.506
is that pigeons all have IBS.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:16.208
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:18.711
Not only are Confederate statues
symbols of slavery

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:20.580
and white supremacy,
they're also ugly.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.716
I mean, this is an actual statue

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:26.418
of Confederate general
Nathan Bedford Forrest.

00:01:26.418 --> 00:01:27.587
I mean, look at his face!

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.588
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:32.324
Is that the face he made
when he lost the Civil War

00:01:32.324 --> 00:01:34.794
or when he walked in
on his parents having sex?

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:36.061
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.061 --> 00:01:37.363
Or both!

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:39.365
"Mother, Father,
I have terrible news!

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:40.400
Oh, no!"

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:44.303
So, that was the context
for the Virginia election,

00:01:44.303 --> 00:01:47.540
which was won by the Democratic
candidate, Ralph Northam.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.075
But now, just over a year later,

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:51.010
virtually every major Democrat
in the country

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.579
is calling on Northam to resign

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:55.181
after his own racist past
surfaced on Friday.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.049
-Calls are getting louder
this evening

00:01:57.049 --> 00:02:00.953
for Democratic Virginia governor
Ralph Northam to resign

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:05.959
after these racist photos
from 1984 surfaced just today.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:07.693
-A decades-old yearbook page

00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:09.328
suddenly
in the spotlight tonight

00:02:09.328 --> 00:02:11.130
because of this picture
of two people,

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:14.701
one in blackface,
the other in a KKK hood.

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.969
The page
belongs to Ralph Northam.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:19.205
He's now the Democratic governor
of Virginia.

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:21.708
That's him in the tie in 1984,

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:24.510
the year he graduated from the
Eastern Virginia Medical School.

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:26.312
-Northam has apologized

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:29.716
but has not said which one
was him in that picture.

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:32.585
-Wow.
That's a real lose-lose.

00:02:32.585 --> 00:02:34.320
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:38.157
That's like being asked whether
you're Erik or Lyle Menendez.

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:39.625
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.625 --> 00:02:42.428
I don't know.
Does it matter?

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:44.430
I'm no professor
of political science,

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.398
but it's not good
when you have to specify

00:02:46.398 --> 00:02:47.967
whether you're the one
in blackface

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:49.602
or the one in the KKK robe.

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:52.104
There's no good option here.

00:02:52.104 --> 00:02:54.206
Even the curtain
in the background of that photo

00:02:54.206 --> 00:02:56.376
had to hold a press conference
to apologize.

00:02:56.376 --> 00:02:58.344
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:01.314
Also, this was in a yearbook?

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:03.649
How do you even sign
a yearbook like that?

00:03:03.649 --> 00:03:05.418
"Too racist to be forgotten"?

00:03:05.418 --> 00:03:07.186
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.186 --> 00:03:09.122
'Course, it was a yearbook
for medical school,

00:03:09.122 --> 00:03:11.524
so it would probably
be impossible to read.

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:13.993
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:16.129
Now, you would think this would
be pretty straightforward.

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:17.963
If you're caught doing something
that horrific

00:03:17.963 --> 00:03:19.298
and your entire party
tells you to quit,

00:03:19.298 --> 00:03:20.766
you resign, end of story.

00:03:20.766 --> 00:03:23.469
And yet somehow, the story got
worse as the weekend went on.

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:26.039
In less than 24 hours,
Northam went from admitting

00:03:26.039 --> 00:03:27.973
he was in the photo
and apologizing for it

00:03:27.973 --> 00:03:29.508
to claiming it wasn't him.

00:03:29.508 --> 00:03:32.311
-When it surfaced Friday on
the website Big League Politics,

00:03:32.311 --> 00:03:35.981
condemnation from fellow
Democrats came hard and fast.

00:03:35.981 --> 00:03:39.018
Northam acknowledged the photo
and apologized twice,

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:41.954
saying it does not represent
the person I am today.

00:03:41.954 --> 00:03:43.522
-Less than 24 hours later,

00:03:43.522 --> 00:03:46.025
he said
he was absolutely certain

00:03:46.025 --> 00:03:49.429
and he never believed that it
was him in that picture.

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:52.732
-When I was confronted
with the images yesterday,

00:03:52.732 --> 00:03:56.235
I was appalled
that they appeared on my page.

00:03:56.235 --> 00:03:59.138
But I believe then and now

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:03.175
that I am not either
of the people in that photo.

00:04:03.175 --> 00:04:05.377
Last night,
I finally had a chance

00:04:05.377 --> 00:04:09.682
to sit down and look at
the photograph in detail.

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:11.484
It is definitely not me.

00:04:11.484 --> 00:04:13.252
I can tell by looking at it.

00:04:13.252 --> 00:04:15.021
I recognize that many people

00:04:15.021 --> 00:04:17.322
will find this difficult
to believe.

00:04:17.322 --> 00:04:20.326
-Oh, do you?
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:22.728
You're telling us
that a racist photo surfaced,

00:04:22.728 --> 00:04:25.464
and your first instinct
was to say, "Yeah, that's me,"

00:04:25.464 --> 00:04:27.734
but then you looked closer
and realized it wasn't?

00:04:27.734 --> 00:04:28.834
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.834 --> 00:04:29.969
Shouldn't even be a question.

00:04:29.969 --> 00:04:31.537
Most normal people,
if you asked them,

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:33.939
did you ever wear blackface
or a KKK robe,

00:04:33.939 --> 00:04:36.308
would go "Absolutely not!
That's insane!"

00:04:36.308 --> 00:04:39.746
But your reaction was,
"Well, what was the prom theme?"

00:04:39.746 --> 00:04:41.346
[ Laughter ]

00:04:41.346 --> 00:04:44.483
And yet Northam's defense got
even worse and more convoluted.

00:04:44.483 --> 00:04:47.820
He tried to claim that he knows
it's not him in the photo

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:52.024
because there was another time
when he did wear blackface,

00:04:52.024 --> 00:04:54.060
and he remembers that time
very clearly.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:57.096
-My belief
that I did not wear that costume

00:04:57.096 --> 00:05:00.265
or attend that party
stems in part

00:05:00.265 --> 00:05:03.869
from my clear memory
of other mistakes I made

00:05:03.869 --> 00:05:07.072
in this same period of my life.

00:05:07.072 --> 00:05:09.675
That same year,
I did participate

00:05:09.675 --> 00:05:12.812
in a dance contest
in San Antonio,

00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:14.480
in which I darkened my face

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:17.583
as part
of a Michael Jackson costume.

00:05:17.583 --> 00:05:21.454
It is because my memory
of that episode is so vivid

00:05:21.454 --> 00:05:25.891
that I truly do not believe I am
in the picture in my yearbook.

00:05:25.891 --> 00:05:28.260
-He's actually arguing
that it couldn't

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.629
have been him in blackface

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:32.331
because there was a different
time he wore blackface.

00:05:32.331 --> 00:05:33.699
[ Laughter ]

00:05:33.699 --> 00:05:36.535
It's not a defense.
That's a confession.

00:05:36.535 --> 00:05:38.471
Try that next time
a cop pulls you over.

00:05:38.471 --> 00:05:39.972
"Officer, I'm totally sober.

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:42.375
Usually when I drive drunk,
I swerve a lot more."

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:44.376
[ Laughter ]

00:05:44.376 --> 00:05:46.145
Even if it's not you
in that photo,

00:05:46.145 --> 00:05:48.246
admitting that you did wear
blackface at a different event

00:05:48.246 --> 00:05:49.482
is also disqualifying.

00:05:49.482 --> 00:05:50.983
It's not just
an embarrassing story,

00:05:50.983 --> 00:05:52.652
it's racist and dehumanizing.

00:05:52.652 --> 00:05:55.088
And yet the press conference,
believe it or not,

00:05:55.088 --> 00:05:58.190
got much, much worse because
Northam then went into detail

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.026
about how he won
the dance contest...

00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:01.360
[ Laughter ]

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:03.662
...and a reporter later
followed up with a question

00:06:03.662 --> 00:06:05.865
that provoked one of
the more cringe-worthy moments

00:06:05.865 --> 00:06:07.766
in recent political history.

00:06:07.766 --> 00:06:09.602
-It was a dance contest.

00:06:09.602 --> 00:06:12.305
I had
always liked Michael Jackson.

00:06:12.305 --> 00:06:14.373
I actually won the contest,

00:06:14.373 --> 00:06:16.942
because I had learned
how to do the moonwalk.

00:06:16.942 --> 00:06:19.145
-You said that the competition
in San Antonio

00:06:19.145 --> 00:06:21.547
was a dance competition?
-Yes.

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:23.515
-And it was that
you danced the moonwalk?

00:06:23.515 --> 00:06:24.550
-That's right.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.118
-Are you still able to moonwalk?

00:06:26.118 --> 00:06:28.020
-Oh.

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:30.556
-Inappropriate circumstances.

00:06:30.556 --> 00:06:33.426
-My wife says,
"Inappropriate circumstances."

00:06:33.426 --> 00:06:34.927
-Look at his face!

00:06:34.927 --> 00:06:38.731
He actually thought
about doing it!

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:40.298
[ Laughter ]

00:06:40.298 --> 00:06:41.734
That is the face of a man

00:06:41.734 --> 00:06:44.302
looking to see if he has room
to moonwalk!

00:06:44.302 --> 00:06:51.744
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:51.744 --> 00:06:54.346
I can't believe --

00:06:54.346 --> 00:06:56.382
I can't believe anyone
has to say this,

00:06:56.382 --> 00:06:59.352
but you can't moonwalk
your way out of this one.

00:06:59.352 --> 00:07:01.153
[ Laughter ]

00:07:01.153 --> 00:07:03.055
His wife was pretty quick
on the draw, though.

00:07:03.055 --> 00:07:05.891
"Inappropriate circumstances,"
right away.

00:07:05.891 --> 00:07:07.560
Obviously,
this isn't the first time

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.095
she's had to stop him
from moonwalking.

00:07:09.095 --> 00:07:10.429
[ Laughter ]

00:07:10.429 --> 00:07:12.664
"You know, it's so good
to be here this christening.

00:07:12.664 --> 00:07:15.301
You know, I think
if Michael Jackson was here --"

00:07:15.301 --> 00:07:16.402
"No, Ralph!"

00:07:16.402 --> 00:07:18.104
[ Laughter ]

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:20.573
Also, I'm gonna guess
that reporter

00:07:20.573 --> 00:07:22.875
changed his question on the fly.

00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:25.945
"Man, I know I should ask about
his plans to stay in office,

00:07:25.945 --> 00:07:28.547
but I really want to see
if I can make him moonwalk!"

00:07:28.547 --> 00:07:31.183
[ Laughter ]

00:07:31.183 --> 00:07:33.886
So, how old were the guys
who finished second and third

00:07:33.886 --> 00:07:35.021
to him in a dance contest?

00:07:35.021 --> 00:07:36.388
[ Laughter ]

00:07:36.388 --> 00:07:39.658
Now, the response from Democrats
has been nearly unanimous.

00:07:39.658 --> 00:07:42.161
Basically, every major Democrat
in the state of Virginia

00:07:42.161 --> 00:07:43.729
and Washington
and across the country

00:07:43.729 --> 00:07:45.197
has called on Northam to resign,

00:07:45.197 --> 00:07:46.832
and yet at least one Republican

00:07:46.832 --> 00:07:48.700
tried to use the Northam scandal
against Democrats.

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:51.070
Donald Trump Jr.
reposted a tweet

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.505
from Senator Kamala Harris,

00:07:52.505 --> 00:07:55.241
congratulating Northam on his
victory two years ago that said,

00:07:55.241 --> 00:07:57.643
"Congratulations
to Ralph Northam and his team

00:07:57.643 --> 00:07:59.812
for showing that Virginia won't
stand for hatred and bigotry."

00:07:59.812 --> 00:08:02.215
Don Jr. added,
"Well, this is awkward

00:08:02.215 --> 00:08:03.849
and didn't age well at all."

00:08:03.849 --> 00:08:05.951
You might not want to comment

00:08:05.951 --> 00:08:08.920
on what's awkward
and not aging well.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:12.859
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:12.859 --> 00:08:17.062
Your dad --
Your dad is the birther

00:08:17.062 --> 00:08:20.899
who proposed a Muslim ban
and said Nazis are fine people,

00:08:20.899 --> 00:08:24.070
so maybe sit this one out,
Grease Frightening.

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:25.771
[ Laughter ]

00:08:25.771 --> 00:08:27.239
Every major Democrat
in the country

00:08:27.239 --> 00:08:29.608
has called on Northam to resign.
He should listen to them.

00:08:29.608 --> 00:08:31.243
Staying on at this point
would be --

00:08:31.243 --> 00:08:33.279
-Inappropriate circumstances.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:33.279 --> 00:08:35.281
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

00:08:35.281 --> 00:08:38.551
[ Cheers and applause ]

